WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.595
Jupiter, bodyguard or not.

00:03.295 --> 00:10.877
Jupiter has three hundred times the mass of the Earth, and its pull rules the traffic of comets and asteroids.

00:11.327 --> 00:18.195
It throws many of them out of the Solar System before they can reach us, and it also sends some our way.

00:18.645 --> 00:22.682
Bodyguard or troublemaker: the sums are still being done.
